nld Dutch; Flemish
nor Norwegian
ori Oriya
pan Panjabi; Punjabi
pol Polish
por Portuguese
pus Pushto; Pashto
ron Romanian; Moldavian; Moldovan
rus Russian
san Sanskrit
sin Sinhala; Sinhalese
